# High-Level Idea

The goal is to create an intelligent assistant that helps users and support teams handle application issues faster by:

* Detecting common errors/issues
* Guiding users through fixes in real time
* Predicting failures before they happen
* Automating repetitive resolution steps
* Escalating unresolved issues to DevOps/support teams

Instead of users getting stuck and manually reaching out to support, the system proactively helps them resolve issues themselves. 

